# Environment Configuration for Portfolio Contact Form

# Recipient email address for visitor contact form submissions:
CONTACT_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=vino2004ammu@gmail.com

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DELIVERY METHOD 1: Instant Web Delivery via FormSubmit (Recommended)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# No credentials or API keys needed.
# When the first visitor message is sent, FormSubmit sends a one-time
# "Activate Form" confirmation email to vino2004ammu@gmail.com.
# Once clicked in Gmail, all visitor messages arrive directly in Vinothini's inbox.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DELIVERY METHOD 2: Direct Gmail SMTP Login (Optional)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If you prefer the Node.js backend to connect directly to Google's SMTP server:
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account: https://myaccount.google.com/security
# 2. Generate an "App Password" (16 characters): https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Enter your Gmail and App Password below (never use your personal login password):
#
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=465
# SMTP_SECURE=true
# SMTP_USER=vino2004ammu@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=abcd efgh ijkl mnop
